NOTE ON THE AUDIO

This licence covers the SOURCE CODE of this project only.

The audio files served by this catalog are NOT covered by it. Each recording
keeps the licence its rights holder released it under — CC0, CC-BY, CC-BY-SA,
public domain, or explicit permission — recorded per track in the `license`
column and returned by the API.

CC-BY and CC-BY-SA tracks require attribution. Every track record carries an
`attribution_text` field with the exact string to reproduce. Reproduce it.
